            part.part + ': ' + part.percussionRetriggers + ' percussion retriggers within max(2ms, 1% of shorter note); maximum overlap ' + part.maxPercussionOverlapMs.toFixed(3) + 'ms. Previous note-offs were ignored; attack times retained.');
